From 5b1fa54daa9abe8da124d866a66b69a5e2f43b83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huangserva <huangserva@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 05:09:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] feat(sm70/tp2): register d256-h12-kv2 causal attention
 geometry

TP2 rank shard of d256-h24-kv4 (same GQA ratio 6, SmallTSplitScale 2).
BF16/INT8 KV routes: small-T decode (v2 key-split kernel), prompt, Volta
flash prefill (64-column tile). Tests cover h12-kv2 for BF16/INT8.
186K INT8 decode T=4: 1401us (h24) -> 861us (h12); 131K 2048-token
prefill 176.0 -> 88.3 ms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
