+# ninfer TP2 plan (2026-09-26) — insertion map (HEAD 7889625)
+- Forward: src/targets/qwen3_6/impl/runtime/text_context_impl.h run_layers:1013; attn_mix:818 (o_proj linear_add :878, variant.cpp:185), gdn_mix:881 (out linear_add :986, variant.cpp:284), mlp_tail:1002 (post_mixer variant.cpp:308: linear_swiglu 34816x5120 + linear_add 5120x17408).
+- Allreduce points: after o_proj, GDN out, MLP down (+ MTP o_proj :413 and mtp_post_mixer variant.cpp:330, already unfused). NVFP4 down is LinearThenAdd (nvfp4_linear_add_plan.cpp:74-90) -> AR between linear and residual_add. FP8 fused for T<=32: rank0 linear_add into x, rank1 into zeroed tmp, then AR.
+- Shapes: TextConfig qwen3_6_27b/impl/config.h:13-58 (q 24->12, kv 4->2, gdn k 16->8, v 48->24, inter 17408->8704). Gates: nvfp4_config.h:120-170, fp8_config.h:122-190, wrapper/linear_add.cpp, linear_swiglu.cpp, attn_input_proj (fp8_attn_input_output.cuh rows [Q6144|K1024|G6144|V1024]), gdn_input_proj (fp8_gdn_input_output.cuh [q2048|k2048|v6144|z6144], static_assert 16384), gdn_projected_conv.cu launch<10240,2048,2048,6144>, CausalConvSplitGeometry, gdn gating H=48, FoldGeometry<48,16,48,10240>, CausalD256H24Kv4 geometry.cuh:25 (+ volta flash tiling, small_t v2 kernel), workspace variant.cpp.
+- Weights: bindings.cpp bind_qwen38_nvfp4_text_layers:350-414; load_mlp:183; QPN prepack at load (shape-generic) -> must prepack sharded tensor. Artifact whole-object only -> make per-rank artifacts offline (tools/artifact, tools/convert/qwen3_8_27b) with new weights_id (package.cpp:84, registry.cpp:196).
+- Graphs: prepare_graphs program_impl.h:10996 (captures+warm launches: collective count must match on both ranks). Prefill eager (text_prefill_impl.h:54). decode_graph.cpp capture ThreadLocal.
+- Lockstep: mirror at Program boundary (advance_prefill, decode, commit...), not HTTP. Seed: forward resolved seed. Start with --no-prefix-reuse --host-kv-mib 0.
+- NCCL: need sm_70 build (~/linkprobe/nccl221). In-graph AR measured 15us@10KB, 24us@40KB; >=160KB fails in graph -> prefill eager.
+- Reference impl: ~/ninfer-duo (plus1998/NInfer-V100-Duo, different ninfer version; host-staged copies 277us/AR -> 53 tok/s@85K).
